meta {
  name: transfer stock
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}inventory/stock/transfer/
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    // Chamber codes; must differ. Required.
    "source_location": "A11",
    "destination_location": "B22",

    // Quantity to move, > 0. Required.
    "quantity": "10",

    // Optional.
    "note": "Split across drawers"
  }
}

docs {
  ## API explanation
  Moves stock between chambers (FR-6.4). Admin or Manager. Can't move more than
  the source holds (FR-6.6). The destination must be empty or hold the same
  component (FR-6.7).

  Rules shared by every stock operation (FR-6):
  - Locations are chamber codes such as `A11` (case-insensitive).
  - A chamber holds one component type (FR-6.2).
  - Quantities must be greater than zero and whole numbers for units that don't allow fractions.
  - Each operation writes an immutable movement (FR-6.5) and runs with row locks, so concurrent operations can't drive a chamber below zero (FR-6.11).
  - The response has the `movement` and the resulting `stock_entries`.

  ## API example response
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Stock transferred.",
    "movement": {
      "id": 9,
      "movement_type": "TRANSFER",
      "movement_type_display": "Transfer",
      "component": {
        "id": 1,
        "name": "DC Gear Motor 12V",
        "part_number": "JGB37-520",
        "unit_symbol": "pcs"
      },
      "source_location": "A11",
      "destination_location": "B22",
      "quantity": "10.000",
      "quantity_before": null,
      "quantity_after": null,
      "unit_price": null,
      "delivery_charge": null,
      "performed_by": {
        "id": 2,
        "username": "karim.hossain",
        "email": "karim.hossain@example.com",
        "role": "MANAGER"
      },
      "project": null,
      "related_movement": null,
      "note": "Split across drawers",
      "created_at": "2026-09-14T22:17:36.687281+06:00"
    },
    "stock_entries": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "location": "A11",
        "chamber": 1,
        "component": {
          "id": 1,
          "name": "DC Gear Motor 12V",
          "part_number": "JGB37-520",
          "unit_symbol": "pcs"
        },
        "quantity": "26.000",
        "note": "",
